0168099_8388064315214783389_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-Q2P7GUKWyYQ7kNvwHegYkF&_nc_oc=AdriOtZeeOeieYIYNODaV5C8eQ6EYfJbrE2n1mnLkpze_bi3LdHUqrem4jRMoQ0WsDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ4H78-Iy1NC0Mj8UFhiz_uHP37Ffl9McPAOQNavSdAgg&oe=6ABA73F8"}, {"file_name": "HT_Screens_2560x1440_5.png", "id": "1051261709402320", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_1051261712735653_3438541724928627709_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FPXjwDcC1E0Q7kNvwHLXsoK&_nc_oc=AdpfdjnH0GD-jEtRtoeWfcfrdpPm480a5KAt0XzVKN0VrgyoI5rrCsAe3zN59Vo3Ju0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKjtcbkauNkPkspriqUjm5n5693jVLAMwTZUlnOfhxfmw&oe=6ABA7FBC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hunt Together KeyArt_Video Cover 2560x1440.png", "id": "859547265899781", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031500_859547269233114_6874294734507533955_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4gsT9eAKVwoQ7kNvwFqcQ_Z&_nc_oc=Adrvs_WA1ntySAmM_0Eohw4TT5Boq9ZL32YTv5sao0PEy9S4gGPyY8K6w1DhLG5Tc-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLdNQvwtaM8MKBzR4VQCOc8oGFhnM-nUknOcMvZsVRZdw&oe=6ABA5DEC"}, "display_name": "Hunt Together", "keywords": ["Horror", "PVP", "Action", "Multiplayer", "Online"], "long_description": "Challenge your friends in a PvP VR Horror game (with Meta Quest x PCVR crossplay)! \ud83d\udc7b\n\nFeel the thrill of a hunt in a 1v1 Duel or up to 1v3 Hide and Seek mode that will push your wits, perceptiveness, and courage to their very limits \ud83d\ude31 Employ a wide array of items, triggers, and skills tailored to your class to outsmart and defeat your adversary - a terrifying, lifeforce-draining Ghost or a dauntless, vigilant Hunter. All of this set in spine-chilling locations such as a haunted Mansion, Mines, or a horrid Orphanage.\n\nFeatures:\n\u2022 Challenge your friends in a spooky horr